  "description": "EH3D-PHOENIX-PNP is a Rust library, a command line and a window that read the position file of a board, give every part its feeder, read the settings of the machine, plan the order of the placements as a JSON job and carry it out on a simulated machine with a simulated camera and vision. It has no machine control yet.",
